{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30124","headline":"上姚谏议 · 刘得仁","name":"上姚谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高文与盛德，皆谓古无伦。\n圣代生才子，明庭有谏臣。\n已瞻龙衮近，渐向凤池新。\n却忆波涛郡，来时岛屿春。\n名因诗句大，家似布衣贫。\n曾暗投新轴，频闻奖滞身。\n照吟清夕月，送药紫霞人。\n终计依门馆，何疑不化鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}